	quest.41564073E0585D52.quest_desc: [
		"&6烈焰人燃烧器必须有烈焰人才能工作。&r"
		""
		"&6To put a Blaze in an Empty Blaze Burner, right-click on a Blaze while holding an Empty Blaze Burner. Alternatively,&r an Empty Blaze Burner can be filled by right-clicking on a Blaze Spawner."
		""
		"&6Blaze Burners 用于在调配配方时加热和超加热 Basin。 &r"
