	quest.6DB5C1778F7129F3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Dowsing Rod&r 是一种魔法工具，用于定位世界中隐藏的&6特定方块&r、矿石或兴趣点。"
		""
		"&6By tuning the rod&r to a particular material, it will vibrate or emit visual cues to guide the user toward the &6nearest source&r, making it an invaluable asset for efficient mining and resource gathering in the &6deep&r."
